WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.839
Ashtami Puja, Eighth day of Navaratri,
Meudon, Paris (France), 30 September 1984.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:11.122
Today is the eighth day of Navaratri,

3
00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:15.502
Loudly.

4
00:00:24.119 --> 00:00:28.500
and it is great day for Sahaja Yogis

5
00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:32.220
because it is the

6
00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:39.526
most important time, period.

7
00:00:48.406 --> 00:00:51.800
That is, the seventh centre,

8
00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:58.173
we have crossed, and we are on the eighth centre.

9
00:01:06.651 --> 00:01:12.426
We need not think about the
Goddess what She did on the eighth day,

10
00:01:12.627 --> 00:01:18.318
we have to think today what
we have to do within ourselves.

11
00:01:26.299 --> 00:01:29.613
After crossing the seventh day,

12
00:01:33.662 --> 00:01:37.526
after crossing the seventh chakra

13
00:01:40.742 --> 00:01:48.001
that is the real ascent in your spiritual ascent.

14
00:01:52.014 --> 00:01:55.500
What are we to do on the eighth one?

15
00:01:59.646 --> 00:02:05.237
It’s so Sahaja that today should be the Ashtami,

16
00:02:10.254 --> 00:02:16.580
because that is the day the
Goddess killed so may evil doers,

17
00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.733
and devils and Rakshasas.

18
00:02:28.205 --> 00:02:33.714
She did it on Her own, alone.

19
00:02:36.779 --> 00:02:43.733
Now these evil forces are manifesting in human beings.

20
00:02:49.647 --> 00:02:52.693
They have spread out.

21
00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:59.233
They are within us.

22
00:03:00.882 --> 00:03:04.533
So we all have to fight

23
00:03:07.693 --> 00:03:10.677
those forces within us.

24
00:03:14.471 --> 00:03:18.471
The war is within ourselves,

25
00:03:20.701 --> 00:03:23.701
is not without.

26
00:03:24.757 --> 00:03:29.232
First when you ascend the seventh chakra

27
00:03:29.433 --> 00:03:33.233
and you are on the eighth step,

28
00:03:33.434 --> 00:03:38.693
you have to remember first you have
to fight those forces within ourselves.

29
00:03:54.446 --> 00:03:58.186
You are all very intelligent people;

30
00:03:59.054 --> 00:04:02.393
bit too intelligent sometimes.

31
00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:09.383
So whatever I say you may twist it,

32
00:04:12.909 --> 00:04:18.133
and may try to use it in your own intelligence.

33
00:04:24.086 --> 00:04:28.086
But it is not in your well-being.

34
00:04:30.206 --> 00:04:34.206
It is not for your ‘hita’, for your good.

35
00:04:36.406 --> 00:04:42.852
You want to use it because
you think you are intelligent,

36
00:04:45.986 --> 00:04:51.640
or maybe that you don't
know you are using it that way.

37
00:04:56.876 --> 00:05:02.753
And that is what one has to know
that these forces are acting within us.

38
00:05:07.452 --> 00:05:10.906
They act through our intelligence,

39
00:05:12.214 --> 00:05:15.333
they act through our emotions,

40
00:05:16.845 --> 00:05:22.140
and they act through our physical being.

41
00:05:25.253 --> 00:05:28.500
So we have to be very careful.

42
00:05:31.997 --> 00:05:35.660
When you ascend into Sahaja Yoga,

43
00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:42.113
we have to be very careful with our intelligence,

44
00:05:45.509 --> 00:05:50.080
because intelligence has capacity to cheat itself.

45
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:57.873
And it will cheat us, nobody else.

46
00:06:00.949 --> 00:06:07.673
It is against us, our own
wealth, against our own powers.

47
00:06:13.502 --> 00:06:16.733
So we have to be alert

48
00:06:18.343 --> 00:06:21.306
and see for ourselves.

49
00:06:22.768 --> 00:06:29.586
So as soon as you enter onto the eighth
step you should start seeing at yourself.

50
00:06:33.042 --> 00:06:35.540
Now, for example,

51
00:06:37.653 --> 00:06:44.766
for example, when I say the
mantra is “I am my own Guru”,

52
00:06:52.247 --> 00:06:58.520
immediately the intelligence comes
forward to render its services-freely.

53
00:07:03.266 --> 00:07:07.380
“Oh! I am my own Guru,
why should I listen to anyone?

54
00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:14.700
Why should I listen to any leader? Why
should I listen to anybody who is elder,

55
00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.933
who understands Sahaja Yoga better?

56
00:07:24.582 --> 00:07:27.460
I am my own Guru!”

57
00:07:27.773 --> 00:07:30.706
The other way it is.

58
00:07:31.693 --> 00:07:38.153
Straightforward thing is that: I am
My own Guru, I have to correct myself.

59
00:07:44.141 --> 00:07:51.133
I have to use this instrument
of light to correct myself.

60
00:07:55.516 --> 00:07:59.386
Now the intelligence cheats again:

61
00:08:01.082 --> 00:08:06.166
“Mother said that if your feel
vibrations, then it’s alright;

62
00:08:08.907 --> 00:08:12.380
and I am feeling the vibrations, I am alright”.

63
00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.580
Again cheating.

64
00:08:19.736 --> 00:08:22.760
You are cheating yourself!

65
00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:29.792
Why? What is the reason?

66
00:08:32.608 --> 00:08:35.560
The reason is very interesting.

67
00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:44.100
I’ve seen that ordinary human beings

68
00:08:45.486 --> 00:08:48.100
– in the West specially

69
00:08:51.713 --> 00:08:56.333
– are very much against themselves.

70
00:08:59.283 --> 00:09:03.968
Like, I’ll give you an example:

71
00:09:05.911 --> 00:09:11.545
You tell somebody that if
you have to go to the station,

72
00:09:11.746 --> 00:09:16.733
take this road and you’ll
go straight to the station.

73
00:09:21.203 --> 00:09:25.260
But immediately he’ll say,
“But the problem is,

74
00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:33.453
that how can I go straight?
My back is towards the station.

75
00:09:36.996 --> 00:09:41.426
If I walk straight I’ll go in
the opposite direction of the station”.

76
00:09:44.164 --> 00:09:48.786
Such stupid things! But they say it, all the time.

77
00:09:53.451 --> 00:10:02.153
Now if you tell them that you can sell your
car better if you go to Germany, for example;

78
00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.933
but they say, “There’s a problem,

79
00:10:12.219 --> 00:10:18.726
maybe the Germans may start their war again.

80
00:10:21.167 --> 00:10:24.946
Maybe there is Hitler waiting for me, to kill me”.

81
00:10:27.881 --> 00:10:33.926
Any fantastic problem, that you can’t never
think of, can come out of this modern brain.

82
00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:47.366
And you are amazed how this
man is against himself all the time!

83
00:10:56.370 --> 00:11:04.520
The whole built-up is like that because before
realisation you are absolutely disintegrated.

84
00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:15.240
Your heart is against your brain,

85
00:11:16.878 --> 00:11:20.346
and your brain is against your liver.

86
00:11:23.327 --> 00:11:27.980
This is the reason they have three types of wives;

87
00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:34.786
one is a love affair,
one is a physical life and one is a wife.

88
00:11:46.756 --> 00:11:53.420
They are so disintegrated that every
cell can have a wife or can have a husband.

89
00:11:59.625 --> 00:12:03.979
The nose will want something,
the eyes will want another thing,

90
00:12:07.005 --> 00:12:10.760
and the hands will do something else

91
00:12:12.275 --> 00:12:15.360
and tongue will say something else.

92
00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.240
When I met the western people,

93
00:12:24.846 --> 00:12:29.040
I had to consult many
dictionaries to understand them.

94
00:12:32.548 --> 00:12:36.846
Could not understand why
they behave in such a funny manner.

95
00:12:40.754 --> 00:12:44.280
They are all the time against themselves.

96
00:12:45.758 --> 00:12:50.860
So after realisation this
habit becomes even subtler.

97
00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:01.306
So now they use Sahaja Yoga
to act against Sahaja Yoga itself.

98
00:13:05.331 --> 00:13:11.189
Sahaja is simple, is straightforward.

99
00:13:13.399 --> 00:13:17.520
They don’t want to have it in that way.

100
00:13:18.804 --> 00:13:25.092
They must always do it in such
a way that it is absolutely Asahaja.

101
00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:35.293
There was a fellow in my house
who was suffering from left side problems.

102
00:13:38.594 --> 00:13:43.040
So I told him that you have to light a lamp

103
00:13:43.241 --> 00:13:47.980
and then take out all your badhas every night.

104
00:13:56.216 --> 00:14:00.599
And we had a big drum of oil in the house.

105
00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:07.266
He did not eat any food, he did not sleep.

106
00:14:07.467 --> 00:14:11.113
He burnt all that oil in one week’s time.

107
00:14:17.536 --> 00:14:20.140
He burnt all the...

108
00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.078
He made all the blankets black,

109
00:14:33.279 --> 00:14:40.880
all the walls black, and burnt all the curtains!

110
00:14:53.843 --> 00:15:01.233
When I came back after eight days,
I said what have you been doing?

111
00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:09.450
–And he looked like a real bhoot!

112
00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:15.779
He said “I was driving out the bhoots.”

113
00:15:18.644 --> 00:15:22.153
I said now this is the limit!

114
00:15:24.661 --> 00:15:27.793
So he said, “Mother you told me”,

115
00:15:30.706 --> 00:15:36.473
I said, “Thank god you did not take
beacon light to burn the whole house!”

116
00:15:44.908 --> 00:15:49.002
So I have to be very careful when I talk with you.

117
00:15:50.694 --> 00:15:54.146
Whenever I tell you one thing, I tell you that

118
00:15:54.347 --> 00:15:58.300
other side of it also immediately,
because I don’t want if I tell you this side,

119
00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.813
you go to the other side, to the other extreme.

120
00:16:12.395 --> 00:16:17.106
So all this kind of this crazy
madness, stupidness I’ve seen.

121
00:16:24.626 --> 00:16:31.360
And today when I’m going to talk to you about
discipline, I must tell you “Discipline has to be Sahaja”.

122
00:16:39.564 --> 00:16:42.239
Now what does that mean?

123
00:16:44.166 --> 00:16:49.720
That is first of all “face yourself”.

124
00:16:52.832 --> 00:16:56.733
What I find, that the western mind,

125
00:16:56.933 --> 00:17:00.999
because of its ego, cannot discipline itself.

126
00:17:07.548 --> 00:17:12.633
If you tell them you have to discipline
they think I’m creating a military out of you.

127
00:17:18.998 --> 00:17:23.256
In a way it ‘is’ a fight.

128
00:17:24.744 --> 00:17:28.246
It is a fight with yourself.

129
00:17:29.794 --> 00:17:33.266
But how will you fight if you have no discipline?

130
00:17:37.009 --> 00:17:40.952
Now if I say, you have to get
up in the morning, take your bath,

131
00:17:41.153 --> 00:17:44.093
and sit down for meditation;

132
00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:52.900
in a Sahaja way you have to tell yourself plainly,

133
00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.719
“Come along, now you have
to get up tomorrow morning”.

134
00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:08.313
In a Sahaja way; the way
you turn your wheels in your car.

135
00:18:12.511 --> 00:18:17.766
So what you do is to, I think,
the whole night you don’t sleep.

136
00:18:18.449 --> 00:18:22.993
Maybe this could be one extreme, is not to sleep.

137
00:18:28.908 --> 00:18:31.660
And get up at 2 o'clock,

138
00:18:32.553 --> 00:18:35.100
disturb the whole house-hold,

139
00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:39.226
fill your tub, and fill
the whole house with water!

140
00:18:43.138 --> 00:18:48.646
And sit down in the
water, and you get cold and sick.

141
00:18:53.734 --> 00:18:57.266
It is absurd!

142
00:19:00.061 --> 00:19:04.513
Why? Because you want to show-off.

143
00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.900
Or maybe you want to hurt yourself.

144
00:19:12.431 --> 00:19:15.586
Both things are wrong.

145
00:19:17.272 --> 00:19:22.746
Whatever has to be done has to
be done in the most pleasurable way.

146
00:19:31.461 --> 00:19:39.053
Either you will not wash the dirt, or you
will wash it such that all the cloth will be torn.

147
00:19:46.714 --> 00:19:49.340
But today as I see the people

148
00:19:50.147 --> 00:19:52.739
—of France, specially,

149
00:19:56.456 --> 00:19:59.380
the French Sahaja Yogis,

150
00:19:59.919 --> 00:20:02.960
I think the discipline is lacking.

151
00:20:06.331 --> 00:20:09.126
I’m quite surprised at it.

152
00:20:11.562 --> 00:20:14.860
The first thing it hits at is that

153
00:20:15.566 --> 00:20:20.320
you cannot manage within a limited amount,

154
00:20:25.834 --> 00:20:29.473
I mean money-wise. It hits you at the money point.

155
00:20:36.012 --> 00:20:38.100
Like in the room there’s light,

156
00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:43.557
nobody will see that it is put off; there’s also
a switch to be put off;–is a practical thing.

157
00:20:43.757 --> 00:20:46.519
I mean one must know.

158
00:20:54.377 --> 00:20:58.033
And the light bill is going
for nothing at all, going up.

159
00:21:00.785 --> 00:21:04.573
Is an irresponsibility, complete irresponsibility.

160
00:21:07.046 --> 00:21:10.060
That it is the money that will be spent,

161
00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:16.986
is just a waste; and for us it is
important to live within sensible means.

162
00:21:31.719 --> 00:21:35.006
First I’ll be dealing with gross discipline.

163
00:21:40.026 --> 00:21:47.899
Now what happens, that if
somebody says why the light is on,

164
00:21:50.022 --> 00:21:55.906
immediately they become very
abstract, they say “We are the light”.

165
00:22:05.629 --> 00:22:10.260
Then you should not have lights at all,
there’s no need to have any light!

166
00:22:11.926 --> 00:22:15.440
Save all the electricity, all the light.

167
00:22:16.724 --> 00:22:21.133
You are the Sun, so you need not have any heating!

168
00:22:28.867 --> 00:22:33.234
That is the way things are funny.

169
00:22:36.841 --> 00:22:44.106
One must understand that on the gross points
we have to disciplined first, and foremost….

170
00:22:50.857 --> 00:22:55.666
We are living in ‘France, not on Himalayas.

171
00:22:58.071 --> 00:23:05.080
So when you live in France, we have
to correct ourselves living in France'.

172
00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:17.233
Now the second gross point is that
there are many who are not working at all.

173
00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:25.640
Is a hippy style life.

174
00:23:27.993 --> 00:23:33.140
Or they work for two days or three days,
and the rest of the time what do they do?

175
00:23:37.938 --> 00:23:40.973
They say we meditate.

176
00:23:42.679 --> 00:23:46.120
Means what? They sleep and snore, that’s all.

177
00:23:48.687 --> 00:23:52.733
You don’t need 24 hours to meditate.

178
00:23:54.474 --> 00:23:58.306
You ‘must’ have jobs, all of you!

179
00:24:00.015 --> 00:24:02.580
Regular jobs.

180
00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:11.413
So many ladies I’m told don’t take jobs once
they marry. They say “let the husband do job”.

181
00:24:18.048 --> 00:24:20.420
It’s very wrong.

182
00:24:20.919 --> 00:24:25.113
If you have the child,
it’s all right, for the time being.

183
00:24:28.923 --> 00:24:34.382
You all must work every day.

184
00:24:37.177 --> 00:24:41.713
There is no day for when we can rest, really.

185
00:24:45.524 --> 00:24:52.069
God created this world in six
days and seventh day He rested.

186
00:24:56.630 --> 00:25:00.173
But the eighth day what did He do?

187
00:25:01.307 --> 00:25:06.013
He started giving realisation; relentlessly.

188
00:25:08.394 --> 00:25:11.519
Working hard.

189
00:25:12.642 --> 00:25:16.159
Could you believe at this age of mine,

190
00:25:20.700 --> 00:25:24.873
within last 2 months how much I have travelled?

191
00:25:28.138 --> 00:25:32.506
Every night sleeping at about 2
o'clock, getting up about 5 o'clock:

192
00:25:36.951 --> 00:25:39.493
I went to America,

193
00:25:40.460 --> 00:25:45.700
came back from there, then throughout England,

194
00:25:48.027 --> 00:25:51.066
the whole month I was travelling

195
00:25:51.736 --> 00:25:56.033
—from north to south, east to west.

196
00:25:56.234 --> 00:26:01.061
Next month out to Switzerland, to Zermatt.

197
00:26:03.685 --> 00:26:08.240
Then to Austria, Munich.

198
00:26:09.785 --> 00:26:13.926
Then back to London.

199
00:26:15.331 --> 00:26:17.540
Then to Italy,

200
00:26:17.820 --> 00:26:20.247
back to London.

201
00:26:20.448 --> 00:26:25.146
Had a Puja there. Again back to France.

202
00:26:26.792 --> 00:26:29.907
Again back to London.

203
00:26:30.107 --> 00:26:32.780
I’ve to change my house,

204
00:26:35.879 --> 00:26:38.806
pack up all the things,

205
00:26:39.007 --> 00:26:41.541
go back to India,

206
00:26:41.742 --> 00:26:48.039
go to Hong Kong, go to China, come back.

207
00:26:48.367 --> 00:26:52.263
Then look after your Ashrams in India.

208
00:26:54.145 --> 00:26:58.929
Six days. Again, come back.

209
00:26:59.129 --> 00:27:03.061
And then to America…

210
00:27:04.147 --> 00:27:08.264
That’s the thing your Mother is doing at this age.

211
00:27:10.402 --> 00:27:13.800
Last night we slept at 3:30.

212
00:27:15.826 --> 00:27:18.840
But then they told us that it’s one hour earlier.

213
00:27:19.040 --> 00:27:23.895
So, we said all right one
hour earlier. So, we slept at 2:30!

214
00:27:30.983 --> 00:27:34.740
But you have to make your body like that,

215
00:27:34.940 --> 00:27:39.446
you see that it should
stand all kinds of discomforts.

216
00:27:47.733 --> 00:27:51.000
You know in Sahaja Yoga
unemployment is not allowed;

217
00:27:51.200 --> 00:27:55.100
to take this money from
the Government is not allowed.

218
00:28:02.718 --> 00:28:08.060
You’ll be surprised; in England we
have maximum unemployment in the whole world,

219
00:28:08.260 --> 00:28:12.546
but there is no Sahaja Yogi is unemployed.

220
00:28:24.884 --> 00:28:29.324
Now you all must earn
sufficiently to pay for your stay.

221
00:28:29.584 --> 00:28:32.820
Nobody should be parasite.

222
00:28:41.326 --> 00:28:45.955
Now the young people who are not educated,

223
00:28:46.155 --> 00:28:50.307
who have no other job

224
00:28:50.507 --> 00:28:53.940
but that of a...

225
00:28:56.059 --> 00:28:59.268
What do you call it? Labour class

226
00:28:59.468 --> 00:29:04.680
or we call it as the garbage cleaners,

227
00:29:22.246 --> 00:29:26.500
must take some sort of
specialisation, to some kind of a mastery,

228
00:29:26.700 --> 00:29:32.470
otherwise people think that
Sahaja Yoga is a group of beggars.

229
00:29:42.875 --> 00:29:48.411
Beggars and unemployed and miserable people.

230
00:29:54.475 --> 00:29:58.553
But you see, when you become your own Guru.

231
00:30:02.747 --> 00:30:05.620
You think that all the Gurus don’t work;

232
00:30:05.820 --> 00:30:08.720
you see their disciples
have to look after them.

233
00:30:14.126 --> 00:30:20.400
The Guru sits down nicely in one
place, and the disciples you see look after.

234
00:30:26.571 --> 00:30:31.592
But not your Guru!
Your Guru has to work very hard.

235
00:30:34.105 --> 00:30:37.960
So you have to be in the
same pattern as your Guru is.

236
00:30:41.760 --> 00:30:46.420
And to hear that “nobody listens, you
tell them anything they don’t do any work,

237
00:30:46.620 --> 00:30:49.702
they are lazy-lumps” is very sad.

238
00:31:01.075 --> 00:31:05.745
Some people sometimes say that
these are the set of lotus-eaters

239
00:31:05.946 --> 00:31:12.519
or some sort of a set of beggars or lepers
who are suffering from horrible diseases.

240
00:31:26.808 --> 00:31:30.340
Then I feel extremely insulted, you know.

241
00:31:35.447 --> 00:31:38.499
You are My children.

242
00:31:41.309 --> 00:31:45.880
How people are going to have respect for you,

243
00:31:46.765 --> 00:31:53.178
or for Me, if you have no discipline?

244
00:31:54.629 --> 00:31:59.393
For French I should say, they
should take to “Mauna” means silence.

245
00:32:04.093 --> 00:32:08.060
Once they take out their lips,
they go on like this, like a bird, I’ve seen:

246
00:32:08.260 --> 00:32:11.873
all the time chuck chuck chuck chuck chuck...

247
00:32:21.819 --> 00:32:25.499
You should exchange with English, who never talk,

248
00:32:27.691 --> 00:32:30.826
they need a bump on the head to
talk.

249
00:32:34.575 --> 00:32:40.046
You ask them ten questions, and they
would not say anything, they’ll just stare.

250
00:32:45.125 --> 00:32:48.313
These two extremes I can’t understand.

251
00:32:49.902 --> 00:32:53.580
Now it’s better to keep quiet,

252
00:32:56.030 --> 00:33:03.706
or it is difficult for us to say
something pleasant to others.

253
00:33:08.336 --> 00:33:16.640
So the first mantra should be, “Mother, teach
us some nice things that we can say to others”.

254
00:33:25.092 --> 00:33:33.251
“What should I say nice tomorrow,
or today, let’s say, today when I get up.

255
00:33:39.085 --> 00:33:41.433
What should I say?

256
00:33:44.630 --> 00:33:48.186
What would give peace to others?”

257
00:33:50.132 --> 00:33:52.212
But not so.

258
00:33:52.413 --> 00:33:55.287
It’s not never the mind
thinks, now, in the morning

259
00:33:55.487 --> 00:33:59.773
I’m going to start with a big spoon,

260
00:34:00.093 --> 00:34:03.806
hitting everyone, “Get up, get up, get up”.

261
00:34:13.139 --> 00:34:17.546
The discipline has to come from ‘within’ yourself.

262
00:34:20.984 --> 00:34:23.886
Nobody has to tell you.

263
00:34:25.379 --> 00:34:28.546
And when somebody tells, you feel hurt.

264
00:34:32.253 --> 00:34:38.146
So I don’t know how to tell
all this that it goes into your heart

265
00:34:38.346 --> 00:34:42.026
and doesn’t remain somewhere in the air.

266
00:34:53.315 --> 00:34:58.366
The discipline of within is
like fragrance of [a] flower.

267
00:35:02.072 --> 00:35:06.613
It gives you complete freedom,
and it gives freedom to others.

268
00:35:11.392 --> 00:35:16.986
See, I would say, I have
certain bad habits or good habits.

269
00:35:22.002 --> 00:35:26.586
Supposing I have a key,
which is very gross thing: key.

270
00:35:30.512 --> 00:35:36.373
At any cost I will not put it here
and there. I’ll put it at the right place.

271
00:35:42.151 --> 00:35:47.100
So, if the key is missing I’m sure it is
lost by somebody else and not by me.

272
00:35:47.300 --> 00:35:52.640
I’m sure about it, because I know myself
very well, I cannot put it anywhere else.

273
00:36:06.292 --> 00:36:09.313
Are you sure about yourself?

274
00:36:11.572 --> 00:36:14.880
Because you are not disciplined, you are not sure.

275
00:36:17.639 --> 00:36:21.066
Like I asked somebody “How are you”?

276
00:36:23.058 --> 00:36:26.753
The person says...

277
00:36:27.511 --> 00:36:29.633
French,

278
00:36:30.012 --> 00:36:33.246
French style.

279
00:36:35.154 --> 00:36:37.919
And Italian style...

280
00:36:38.787 --> 00:36:40.787
they go inside.

281
00:36:44.308 --> 00:36:48.053
Confused, I’m confused – English.

282
00:36:51.542 --> 00:36:54.106
Now, what is that?

283
00:36:58.147 --> 00:37:02.436
Are you realised or not?

284
00:37:08.765 --> 00:37:13.200
They’ve been very kind,
you see, to Me, they think.

285
00:37:19.694 --> 00:37:24.166
Now the time is so short

286
00:37:25.239 --> 00:37:28.386
and you are going like this...

287
00:37:32.739 --> 00:37:36.083
What should I feel?

288
00:37:39.368 --> 00:37:43.060
So today is the day when

289
00:37:44.406 --> 00:37:50.586
your Mother took out
the sword to kill all the enemies,

290
00:37:50.787 --> 00:37:57.473
and you have to kill the greatest enemy
within you, indiscipline and irresponsibility.

291
00:38:21.882 --> 00:38:28.446
Funny ideas people use to justify
their stupidity and their indiscipline.

292
00:38:35.312 --> 00:38:41.140
I know of a Sahaja Yogi who would
never take a bath, for a year at least!

293
00:38:47.193 --> 00:38:50.540
And he was reported to Me.

294
00:38:52.209 --> 00:38:57.279
And when I asked him, why
don’t you take bath, he said, “I’m detached”.

295
00:39:05.222 --> 00:39:08.340
So I said you go and live
in Himalayas with this detachment,

296
00:39:08.540 --> 00:39:11.400
you see others are feeling attached.

297
00:39:11.601 --> 00:39:14.380
Other are feeling impossible to live with you.

298
00:39:24.867 --> 00:39:27.973
You have to be kind to others.

299
00:39:30.455 --> 00:39:36.360
You have to neat and clean, is a very
simple thing that I have to tell you now.

300
00:39:43.055 --> 00:39:47.060
All these are the signs of inner cleanliness.

301
00:39:51.551 --> 00:39:56.176
So we come to the subtler side.

302
00:39:59.591 --> 00:40:05.403
And the subtler side of Sahaja
Yoga is extremely simple.

303
00:40:09.574 --> 00:40:12.333
Is compassion.

304
00:40:13.828 --> 00:40:16.613
Is forgiveness.

305
00:40:17.288 --> 00:40:20.113
Is love.

306
00:40:23.009 --> 00:40:29.286
But the greatest of all, is the service to God.

307
00:40:35.168 --> 00:40:39.127
We are doing the work of God.

308
00:40:41.340 --> 00:40:44.220
How can we be tired?

309
00:40:45.067 --> 00:40:47.986
How can we be tired?

310
00:40:50.671 --> 00:40:53.446
How can we be unhappy?

311
00:40:55.195 --> 00:40:58.180
The dynamic is flowing through us,

312
00:41:00.786 --> 00:41:04.466
that compassion is so fulfilling,

313
00:41:07.085 --> 00:41:10.473
that love is so beautifying

314
00:41:13.424 --> 00:41:19.713
that how can we not do it?

315
00:41:23.115 --> 00:41:26.033
We should run to do it.

316
00:41:27.645 --> 00:41:31.160
But we have to know that this love

317
00:41:31.360 --> 00:41:35.220
has a “tremendous” urge within itself.

318
00:41:42.426 --> 00:41:47.146
For example, if you
love someone, if you have a child,

319
00:41:49.246 --> 00:41:54.601
how, how worried you are about that child,

320
00:41:54.801 --> 00:41:57.706
how much you work for that child.

321
00:42:02.679 --> 00:42:06.120
If the compassion is manifested,

322
00:42:06.340 --> 00:42:10.233
you will see the whole
world is created out of that.

323
00:42:14.985 --> 00:42:19.400
God has created this universe, this world

324
00:42:19.601 --> 00:42:24.713
and you people out of this compassion
only, just His compassion.

325
00:42:34.106 --> 00:42:38.879
Somebody asked Me one day,
“why did you take this headache upon Himself?”

326
00:42:43.502 --> 00:42:46.546
This headache is so nice,

327
00:42:49.179 --> 00:42:52.313
is such a beautiful burden,

328
00:42:54.743 --> 00:42:58.960
because there are so many possibilities.

329
00:43:02.004 --> 00:43:06.035
So one has to be optimistic.

330
00:43:07.429 --> 00:43:10.180
But you will realise when you are optimistic,

331
00:43:10.380 --> 00:43:13.364
you give lectures to others
but not to yourself that,

332
00:43:13.565 --> 00:43:18.353
“ ‘I’ have to optimistic of improving myself.

333
00:43:32.517 --> 00:43:35.873
Optimistic in my own love.

334
00:43:37.610 --> 00:43:40.400
It’s so rewarding,

335
00:43:42.931 --> 00:43:45.326
it’s so joy giving”.

336
00:43:48.429 --> 00:43:52.786
Such people come up very fast,

337
00:43:56.670 --> 00:44:00.320
their Kundalini rises very fast.

338
00:44:02.679 --> 00:44:05.800
They become beautiful people.

339
00:44:07.555 --> 00:44:10.746
They do constructive work in Sahaja Yoga.

340
00:44:12.890 --> 00:44:16.226
They do not create rifts and groups.

341
00:44:19.707 --> 00:44:23.606
They don’t use Sahaja
Yoga for fulfilling their ego

342
00:44:26.538 --> 00:44:31.886
but they use Sahaja Yoga for
fulfilling their spiritual ascent.

343
00:44:36.410 --> 00:44:40.113
It depends on how you want to use it.

344
00:44:43.508 --> 00:44:49.149
So today on this day of Ashtami,
which is a very powerful day,

345
00:44:53.000 --> 00:45:00.419
you assume that power within yourself that I can
fight all these horrible diseases within myself.

346
00:45:08.412 --> 00:45:12.540
And for others I will have compassion and love.

347
00:45:14.850 --> 00:45:17.880
I will have not others!

348
00:45:19.916 --> 00:45:26.160
This is the point we miss always. They think
“Mother is giving lectures to others not to me.”

349
00:45:34.531 --> 00:45:40.959
And that compassion will bring
forth the beauty of Sahaja Yoga.

350
00:45:46.436 --> 00:45:50.479
There are certain divine laws.

351
00:45:52.797 --> 00:45:55.620
And you cannot cross them.

352
00:45:56.713 --> 00:46:00.646
If you cross them, I cannot help you at all.

353
00:46:04.034 --> 00:46:09.373
Now if you say, “That I put chillies
in my eyes, they should not burn”,

354
00:46:14.245 --> 00:46:17.045
I can’t help you.

355
00:46:17.519 --> 00:46:21.406
Whatever are divine laws you must follow them.

356
00:46:26.962 --> 00:46:32.306
Like in France, if you drive on the
right side, you will jump in the river.

357
00:46:38.348 --> 00:46:40.551
Gauche is left?
Translator: Left.

358
00:46:40.752 --> 00:46:44.660
Shri Mataji: No, right.
Translator: We drive right.

359
00:46:44.860 --> 00:46:47.260
Shri Mataji: You drive right.
Translator: The English drive left.

360
00:46:47.460 --> 00:46:50.980
Shri Mataji: So I was saying
that if you in France, drive right

361
00:46:51.413 --> 00:46:53.826
then you are in trouble.

362
00:46:54.027 --> 00:46:56.620
Translator: We do drive right.
Shri Mataji: You drive right?

363
00:46:56.821 --> 00:47:00.380
Translator: Yes
Shri Mataji: Oh I see. So here if you drive left,

364
00:47:01.180 --> 00:47:05.413
I will be in trouble, I must say!

365
00:47:08.665 --> 00:47:12.733
Because I don’t understand human laws so well!

366
00:47:18.748 --> 00:47:21.546
Like in England different law,

367
00:47:21.959 --> 00:47:26.980
in France another law, in America another law.

368
00:47:34.260 --> 00:47:36.260
Funny people.

369
00:47:38.099 --> 00:47:42.347
But in God’s realm, everywhere the same law.

370
00:47:44.612 --> 00:47:48.466
Whether you are in France,
or England, or India, same law.

371
00:47:50.981 --> 00:47:53.380
Whether on this earth or on the moon,

372
00:47:53.580 --> 00:48:01.120
or on the Jupiter, same laws.

373
00:48:04.528 --> 00:48:09.040
Whether in human beings,
animals or nature, same laws.

374
00:48:12.797 --> 00:48:15.860
But you know the law.

375
00:48:18.207 --> 00:48:21.180
You are the drivers,

376
00:48:22.582 --> 00:48:25.366
so you have to be careful.

377
00:48:26.309 --> 00:48:31.512
If the driver does not know
driving laws, God save passengers.

378
00:48:36.198 --> 00:48:42.489
So, one must know that
these are the laws of the divine,

379
00:48:42.690 --> 00:48:46.173
that we have to live with self-respect,

380
00:48:48.900 --> 00:48:53.046
that we have to be chaste,

381
00:48:55.659 --> 00:48:59.233
that we have to have dignity,

382
00:49:02.141 --> 00:49:06.340
that we cannot steal things and steal money

383
00:49:06.540 --> 00:49:09.266
and [be] parasites.

384
00:49:13.678 --> 00:49:19.633
That we cannot kill others and we cannot beat
others and say harsh things, they are just the same.

385
00:49:26.372 --> 00:49:31.052
And that we have respect,

386
00:49:34.423 --> 00:49:39.767
the respect for all that is sublime.

387
00:49:41.670 --> 00:49:46.638
Respect for all the saints that are Sahaja Yogis.

388
00:49:48.855 --> 00:49:53.260
And the respect for the leaders

389
00:49:54.553 --> 00:49:57.564
who represent your Mother.

390
00:49:59.900 --> 00:50:05.728
With all this, we are very different people.

391
00:50:11.283 --> 00:50:13.860
We are different race.

392
00:50:15.219 --> 00:50:20.606
We are virtuous, we are righteous
and we are proud to be that way.

393
00:50:24.685 --> 00:50:27.180
We are sure of everything.

394
00:50:28.286 --> 00:50:31.066
We know about everything.

395
00:50:31.986 --> 00:50:36.345
And we are personified

396
00:50:36.546 --> 00:50:42.219
or we are personification
of compassion, of love of God.

397
00:50:46.262 --> 00:50:48.660
That’s what we are.

398
00:50:49.536 --> 00:50:52.799
We are not ordinary people.

399
00:50:54.904 --> 00:50:59.080
I asked a child, “Who is our friend?”

400
00:51:04.747 --> 00:51:07.646
She said, “Only one”.

401
00:51:09.146 --> 00:51:11.846
I said, “Why?”

402
00:51:13.865 --> 00:51:19.000
“Because she is a Sahaja Yogini,
the rest are all ordinary people”.

403
00:51:25.568 --> 00:51:28.193
What about the teacher?

404
00:51:28.817 --> 00:51:31.126
“Very ordinary”.

405
00:51:32.702 --> 00:51:36.013
And what about your Headmistress?

406
00:51:37.692 --> 00:51:40.273
“She is absolutely ordinary!”

407
00:51:41.691 --> 00:51:46.420
Then I showed her the
photograph of the Prime Minister.

408
00:51:50.526 --> 00:51:54.225
She looked at it and she was quite surprised.

409
00:51:54.426 --> 00:52:00.362
She said, “this one is even more
ordinary than my headmistress”.

410
00:52:11.441 --> 00:52:15.033
She said with great, you see, disgust,

411
00:52:15.233 --> 00:52:18.620
“Mother why do you keep
such photographs with you?”

412
00:52:29.966 --> 00:52:32.876
That’s what we are.

413
00:52:33.077 --> 00:52:37.086
The children understand more than us, is it?

414
00:52:39.640 --> 00:52:44.759
Because our brain is against us perhaps,
sometimes; over developed brain.

415
00:52:48.059 --> 00:52:54.099
So, yesterday I saw many people
having Ekadasha, I was surprised.

416
00:52:59.175 --> 00:53:04.053
So, I told them just say,
“Mother, you be in my head”.

417
00:53:09.480 --> 00:53:12.660
Because I have no intelligence.

418
00:53:15.713 --> 00:53:18.516
I’m too simple.

419
00:53:18.717 --> 00:53:22.680
You should all become simple like Me.

420
00:53:26.177 --> 00:53:29.033
Absolutely simple person.

421
00:53:32.461 --> 00:53:35.193
That’s very effective!

422
00:53:37.604 --> 00:53:40.759
Now I must say, yesterday
I was a little surprised that

423
00:53:40.960 --> 00:53:44.926
there were two ladies that
were very emotionally disturbed.

424
00:53:50.373 --> 00:53:53.546
And rather dangerously disturbed.

425
00:53:56.688 --> 00:54:00.586
I would like to meet them after the program.

426
00:54:04.100 --> 00:54:06.444
Now I think I have covered most of the points.

427
00:54:06.759 --> 00:54:10.366
But if you have any question,
you can ask Me today.

428
00:54:22.713 --> 00:54:25.700
Sahaja Yogi: Shri Mother,
quite sometimes the chakras,

429
00:54:25.900 --> 00:54:31.921
the same chakras, we feel them
more on legs than on the fingers?

430
00:54:32.122 --> 00:54:37.413
Shri Mataji: The integration is not there,
that’s why. You have to attend collectively.

431
00:54:37.614 --> 00:54:41.183
You have to be more collective;
the body has to be collective.

432
00:54:41.384 --> 00:54:44.180
The thing is that if you
are not a collective person

433
00:54:44.380 --> 00:54:48.360
then sometimes you’ll feel them on the legs,
sometimes on the heart, sometimes in the head.

434
00:54:48.561 --> 00:54:52.052
That’s not a good thing. You should
try to be more collective, you should

435
00:54:52.253 --> 00:54:54.500
meet more people, take more interest.

436
00:54:54.700 --> 00:55:00.180
You see, the body of yours won’t work out

437
00:55:00.606 --> 00:55:04.866
efficiently unless and until you use it.

438
00:55:38.756 --> 00:55:44.265
Because individually, you see,
individually if you work out,

439
00:55:44.493 --> 00:55:50.642
it will not develop collectively,
because where are you using it?

440
00:55:50.843 --> 00:55:54.236
You are correcting yourself to give it to others.

441
00:55:54.436 --> 00:55:59.070
And if you don’t give it, if you do
not work it out in a collective way,

442
00:55:59.270 --> 00:56:02.293
there is no circulation.

443
00:56:20.098 --> 00:56:23.832
For example, there’s a, say, a fruit is there

444
00:56:24.033 --> 00:56:27.966
and you take it out of a tree,

445
00:56:28.566 --> 00:56:31.082
and you mature it.

446
00:56:36.672 --> 00:56:38.672
Outside.

447
00:56:39.841 --> 00:56:44.388
But it will decay very soon.

448
00:56:46.351 --> 00:56:50.540
But if it is connected with the tree,

449
00:56:51.493 --> 00:56:54.826
it will mature by itself

450
00:56:55.733 --> 00:57:00.860
giving a proper identity to itself

451
00:57:01.593 --> 00:57:04.100
and to the tree.

452
00:57:23.858 --> 00:57:27.053
And taste would be better.

453
00:57:28.289 --> 00:57:32.852
And those who will come under that tree

454
00:57:33.053 --> 00:57:36.733
will receive the fruits of that tree.

455
00:57:42.615 --> 00:57:47.879
But a fruit which is separated
will be lost after some time.

456
00:57:54.803 --> 00:57:59.601
That is how one has to very collective.

457
00:58:04.525 --> 00:58:08.739
Sahaja Yogi: How to develop
our discrimination, Mother?

458
00:58:08.966 --> 00:58:13.699
Shri Mataji: Discrimination
comes through Hamsa Chakra, more.

459
00:58:20.450 --> 00:58:25.060
And Hamsa is a very simple thing,

460
00:58:25.260 --> 00:58:28.740
is to put some ghee in the nose,

461
00:58:29.853 --> 00:58:32.346
is the physical thing.

462
00:58:40.608 --> 00:58:44.820
On the emotional side, one
should not cry too much.

463
00:58:48.640 --> 00:58:52.620
Or women specially have too much crying business.

464
00:58:55.490 --> 00:59:02.033
I also sometimes feel like crying, but seldom.

465
00:59:06.464 --> 00:59:09.693
So sometimes men must cry also.

466
00:59:15.370 --> 00:59:20.299
Now spiritually, to develop discrimination

467
00:59:20.500 --> 00:59:25.806
is by vibratory awareness.

468
00:59:32.547 --> 00:59:35.973
When your vibrations are developed,

469
00:59:39.682 --> 00:59:44.466
then you automatically discriminate.

470
00:59:48.757 --> 00:59:52.013
You are such a big computer.

471
00:59:55.035 --> 01:00:01.266
It has to work in its full way, and then
you’ll be amazed what a computer you are.

472
01:00:08.329 --> 01:00:11.653
I’ll give you an example of Warren now.

473
01:00:16.445 --> 01:00:19.140
There was a,

474
01:00:19.593 --> 01:00:26.753
Pat’s husband Prole [David], who was
measuring My house for certain purpose,

475
01:00:39.597 --> 01:00:42.406
while Warren was sleeping.

476
01:00:42.973 --> 01:00:46.693
Poor David was working, Warren was sleeping.

477
01:00:50.825 --> 01:00:56.506
And in his dream, he dreamt that he
had finished with the last measurement.

478
01:01:03.693 --> 01:01:06.600
And in his half-sleep he got up

479
01:01:10.019 --> 01:01:14.533
and he told him that this
house measures, how much?

480
01:01:14.734 --> 01:01:18.207
Warren: Three thousand
nine hundred and sixteen square feet.

481
01:01:18.407 --> 01:01:22.226
Shri Mataji: Three thousand nine
hundred and sixteen square feet.

482
01:01:35.103 --> 01:01:39.546
And ‘exactly’ that’s what he
had written! David Prole.

483
01:01:46.031 --> 01:01:50.920
Poor David had worked
so hard measuring everything!

484
01:01:56.129 --> 01:02:01.564
He actually fell from his
chair, you see, he couldn’t sit!

485
01:02:02.831 --> 01:02:08.253
Like today I told Guido

486
01:02:08.520 --> 01:02:13.340
that I think I spent three
hundred and eighty pounds.

487
